	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Gottes gnad zuvor!</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="de">Die exemplaria han ich em<lb xml:id="p1z2"/>pfangen bi dem <persName>Gallo</persName>, der in <placeName ref="l832">Franckrych</placeName> zücht, <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>sag üch großen danck üwers flißes und arbeit; <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>wils verdienen, wo mir müglich.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Quod autem attinet <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>causam <placeName ref="l167">Genevensem</placeName>, cuius exitum scire desideras, sic habet: <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>Mulctatus est exilio <persName ref="p6355">Hieronymus</persName> ille et gravior<lb xml:id="p1z7"/>a forte, ni vestrae simul et nostrae literae negocium <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>mitigassent, passus fuisset.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Nunc, sicut <persName ref="p3429">Viretus</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>ad me scribit, agit alicubi in agro nostro, unde fit, <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>ut <persName ref="p3429">Viretus</persName> et omnes illi, qui sunt anima quasi <persName ref="p540">Calvini</persName>, valde <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>sint inquieti; vellent illum a nostris quoque relegari.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z12"/>Gravissimas hac de re ad me scribit <persName ref="p3429">Viretus</persName>, quasi <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>actum sit de ecclesia in universum, si homo ille, quantumvis paci<lb xml:id="p1z14"/>fice agat, feratur.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Ita revolvetur ad nos tandem, quicquid <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>id est mali, cui nisi moderata constantia contra eatur, <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>turbas sentiemus gravissimas.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Dominus illa avertet spiritu et <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>gratia sua, amen.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Quod alia nova attinet, nihil <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>habeo praeter illa, quae abs te et a <persName ref="p3375">Vergerio</persName> accepi, nisi <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>forte hoc tibi novum sit, quod ex <placeName ref="l18">Augusta</placeName> ad <persName ref="p8417">Musculum</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>scribitur, <persName ref="p18250">Mauritium</persName> et alios multos principes <placeName ref="l822">Germaniae</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>inter quos etiam dux <placeName ref="l572">Wirtenbergensis</placeName> et civitas <placeName ref="l491">Argento<lb xml:id="p1z22"/>ratensis</placeName>, confessiones fidei suę misisse <placeName ref="l1107">Tridentum</placeName>; illic <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>Italos episcopos plęrosque noluisse, ut legerentur, sed <placeName ref="l307">Moguntinu<lb xml:id="p1z24"/>m</placeName> et <placeName ref="l1028">Treverensem</placeName> interposuisse suam authoritatem <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>et omnino, ut legerentur, ursisse, alioqui ipsos concilium derelinquere <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>velle.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Itaque lectas et multorum corda esse compuncta <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>atque ex ea lectione hoc esse secutum, ut omnia sint suspensa iam, <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>et patres, quid agant et quomodo, nescire etc.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Verane sint <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>haec vel minus, nescio.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Quia sic ad ipsum scripta sunt, <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>volui tibi quoque communicare, quamvis rectius ex ipsius forte li<lb xml:id="p1z31"/>teris cognosces.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Caeterum, quod literas alias attinet, <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>quas mihi curandas mandasti, curavi diligenter.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z33"/><persName ref="p3241">Trempius</persName> vero lectis suis ad me venit, ... <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>percontatur de quodam libello scripto, cuius..<lb xml:id="p1z35"/>. gener tuus mentionem faciat in suis ad ipsum literis; e[um enim<lb xml:id="p1z36"/>] se non vidisse neque accepisse libellum.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Ego ve[ro nihil] <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>illi respondere potui, qui nihil accepi praeter duos <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>fasciculos ad ipsum pertinentes, in quorum uno tuam, in <lb xml:id="p1z39"/>altero <persName>Zvinglii</persName> agnovi manum; eos ad illum misi.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Facias <lb xml:id="p1z40"/>ergo illum certiorem, si forte neglexerit mittere hoc, de <lb xml:id="p1z41"/>quo tamen scribit, aut si misit, <persName>Gallus</persName> ille mihi non <lb xml:id="p1z42"/>reddidit; nihil enim amplius vidi, quam quod dixi.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z43"/>Dem gfatter <persName>Elßbet</persName> danckend umb sin guͦt jar; <lb xml:id="p1z44"/>gott gebe imm und üch allen vil guͦter.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="de">Ich hatt <lb xml:id="p1z45"/>imm znechst von der gotten wegen ein dicken pf[enning] zur <lb xml:id="p1z46"/>gab gschickt, weiß aber nitt, ob er imm worden oder <lb xml:id="p1z47"/>vilicht verloren ist.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="de">Das läder und seil hab ich dem <lb xml:id="p1z48"/>botten nitt dörffen ufgeben; wils üch znechst schicken.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z49"/>Scharnachtals halben, lieber, hend sorg, das ich nienen vermeldet <lb xml:id="p1z50"/>werde.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="de">Gott mitt üch.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="de" ana="salute">Gruͤßend uns allen die üweren.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z51"/>Datum in yl den 13. ianuarij 1552.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z52"/><persName ref="p8018">Ioannes Haller</persName> tuus perpetuo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="de">Die buͤchli <pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>sind hüpsch und gfallend mir wol.</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="de">Min bruͦder aber hatt gällt, das mir zuͦ ghört; dem <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>schrib ich hiemitt; der wirt den binderlon und das trinkgällt ußrichten.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la">Claris<lb xml:id="p2z3"/>simo viro m. <persName ref="p495">Heinrycho Bullingero</persName>, <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinae</placeName> ecclesiae fidelissimo pastori, domino ac compatri <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>suo colendissimo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="de">M. <persName ref="p495">Heinrych Bullinger</persName>n zuͦ <placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
